@coderabbitai Implemented a bounded recovery for unusable REST evidence: after the configured consecutive-observation limit, the shared priority snapshot degrades to reserve mode, so progress resumes while deferrable work remains paused. The counter resets on valid evidence.

Updated `.agents/scripts/pulse-rate-limit-circuit-breaker.sh`, `.agents/scripts/pulse-budget-priority.sh` coverage, and `.agents/scripts/pulse-merge-routine.sh`; focused circuit-breaker and budget-priority tests pass. The local commit is `9227570da`, but the PR branch could not be pushed because its pre-push typecheck requires unavailable `bun`; leaving this thread open.

